              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ostrum, ostrī — \"purple dye; purple cloth\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Dīves vestem ostrō tīnctam gerit. The rich man wears a garment dyed with purple."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Second declension, neuter: ostrum, ostrī n. A word of poetry for the dye and for cloth coloured with it."
            }
          ]
        },
